{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2022-04-14 10:00:00', 'title': 'NORFOLK SOUTHERN OFFERING CONDUCTOR STARTING BONUSES OF $5,000 IN THREE NEW LOCATIONS', 'text': 'CAREER IN RAILROADING OFFERS MINIMUM $52,000 ANNUAL PAY, BEST-IN-CLASS HEALTHCARE BENEFITS, FEDERAL RETIREMENT PROGRAM, AND ADVANCEMENT OPPORTUNITIES ATLANTA , APRIL 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION (NYSE: NSC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE EXPANSION OF ITS CONDUCTOR TRAINEE INCENTIVE PROGRAM TO THREE NEW PRIORITY LOCATIONS. CONDUCTOR TRAINEES IN BELLEVUE, OHIO; ELKHART, INDIANA; AND FORT WAYNE, INDIANA ARE NOW ELIGIBLE TO RECEIVE STARTING BONUSES OF $5,000.'}